        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You love cars. Sure, lots of people love their specific car, but it's about more than that for you. Automobiles have been your lifelong passion, and your professional expertise has possibly led to a career as a professional racer, pit crew engineer, or trusted local mechanic.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Dexterity</strong> or <strong>Intelligence</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Crafting skill and the Vehicle Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.feats.Item.Pit Stop] skill feat.</p>"
